<title>UK: Attempt to refloat iron ore bulker later Friday.</title>
<headline>Attempt to refloat iron ore bulker later Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operations to lighter the bulk carrier Buzias, aground with a cargo of iron ore off Langeland island, Denmark are continuing and an attempt to refloat the vessel will be made later on Friday, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>The 54,615 dwt vessel ran aground on May 19.</p>
